<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Codex independent TIBETAN-FIRST PROVISIONAL proposal. Harsh-speech members use full English words; unpleasant remains a complete negative phrase. GI/their is the local words-to-meaning relation. The complete hearer agentive stays whole, and additive too is preserved as correct current source wording. Source origin f614639348a03fa30cc53db1b27c6b2034df43cb through354; actual through357 acceptance is a separately supplied later checkpoint, never invented.</div>
